In the feature extraction stage, the model systematically integrates multi-scale geometric features, DSSP structural features, and ProtTrans sequence embeddings to comprehensively represent the sequence and structural information of ABPs. The multi-scale geometric features cover three levels: features between neighboring residues, features between connected residues, and intra-residue features. As shown in Fig. 2A, features between neighboring residues include \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
