$C_\alpha -C_\beta $\end{document} vectors on side chains and dihedral angle embeddings. This design constructs a hierarchical geometric representation from local to global scales. DSSP features further provide scalar parameters such as the secondary structure type and solvent-accessible surface area for each residue. ProtTrans generates 1024-dimensional embeddings that encode deep evolutionary and semantic information. After extracting these features, the multi-modal information is structured as input representations for the graph neural network. The specific classification of features is illustrated in Fig. 2B.

