To further evaluate the effect of loss function selection on model performance, we compared the performance of GGN-ABPMIC under different loss functions, including MDH-loss, conventional MSE loss, and Huber loss. As shown in Table 2, when MSE loss was used instead, the performance declined noticeably, with the average MSE increasing to 0.247, \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
